  <header>
    <h1>Amazon Bestselling Books: Price vs. User Rating Trend Analysis (2009–2019)</h1>
    <p class=\"subtitle\">A management-oriented view of how pricing relates to customer satisfaction, how those dynamics differ by genre, and how both shifted year-over-year across Amazon’s annual Top‑50 bestseller lists (550 entries, 2009–2019).</p>
