      {title:'Treat 2015-style price resets as a viable lever—without sacrificing satisfaction.', body:`The 2015 average price drop (Δ ${fmtUSD(DATA.yoy.find(d=>d.Year===2015).dPrice)}) coincides with ratings staying high and rising thereafter (2015 rating ${fmt3(find(2015).avgRating)} → 2019 ${fmt3(find(2019).avgRating)}).`},
