      <div class=\"grid three-col\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">
        <div class=\"card\"><h3>Avg Price by Year</h3><div class=\"chart-wrap\"><canvas id=\"linePriceGenre\"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class=\"card\"><h3>Avg Rating by Year</h3><div class=\"chart-wrap\"><canvas id=\"lineRatingGenre\"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class=\"card\"><h3>Avg Reviews by Year</h3><div class=\"chart-wrap\"><canvas id=\"lineReviewsGenre\"></canvas></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"section\">
      <div class=\"section-title\">
        <h2>4) Year-over-Year Trends in Pricing and Ratings (Most Critical)</h2>
        <p>Trend lines with a delta table to highlight inflection years.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=\"grid two-col\">
        <div class=\"card\">
          <h3>Overall Trend: Price & Rating</h3>
          <div class=\"chart-wrap tall\"><canvas id=\"trendOverall\"></canvas></div>
        </div>
        <div class=\"card\">
          <h3>Inflection Points (YoY deltas)</h3>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Year</th><th class=\"num\">Δ Avg Price</th><th class=\"num\">Δ Avg Rating</th><th class=\"num\">Δ Avg Reviews</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id=\"inflectionTable\"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class=\"grid two-col\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">
        <div class=\"card\"><h3>Overall Trend: Reviews</h3><div class=\"chart-wrap\"><canvas id=\"trendReviews\"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class=\"card\"><h3>Management narrative</h3><ul class=\"bullets\" id=\"trendBullets\"></ul></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"section\">
      <div class=\"section-title\">
        <h2>5) Dominant Authors on the Bestseller List</h2>
        <p>Repeat authorship as a signal for franchise investment and durable demand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=\"grid two-col\">
        <div class=\"card\"><h3>Top Authors by Appearances</h3><div class=\"chart-wrap tall\"><canvas id=\"authorsBar\"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class=\"card\">
          <h3>Top 15 Author KPIs</h3>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Author</th><th class=\"num\">Appearances</th><th class=\"num\">Unique Titles</th><th class=\"num\">Avg Price</th><th class=\"num\">Avg Rating</th><th class=\"num\">Avg Reviews</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id=\"authorTable\"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class=\"section\">
      <div class=\"section-title\">
        <h2>6) Strategic Recommendations</h2>
        <p>Recommendations grounded in the computed results (no speculation).</p>
      </div>
      <div class=\"card\">
        <ol id=\"recoList\" style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px\"></ol>
      </div>
    </section>
